  "content_html": "<h1>hi honey</h1>\n<p class=\"momentDate\">c. 2024</p>\n<div data-docs-catalogue-ref=\"c1\"></div>\n<pre class=\"moment-text\">\nHi honey\ni’m home\nhope all is well\n \ndoes being lonely\nmean that I’m alone?\n \nis this the right way?\ndoes anyone here\nknow how to read a map?\n \ni see meaning\nin the slightest things\ni have no idea what they mean\n \nthen I realise…\ni’m staring at random dots\n</pre>\n",
